  "goodToKnow": "Scheu means shy or timid, mostly of animals (ein scheues Reh) and also of people: ein scheues Lächeln. Die Scheu is shyness or reluctance: ohne Scheu (without inhibition), Menschenscheu (fear of people). The verb scheuen means to shy away from: keine Mühe scheuen (to spare no effort), and of horses, to shy. Synonyms: schüchtern (shy), ängstlich (anxious)."
